---
description: Motion design standards.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Animation Philosophy

Motion should support usability,

not distract from it.

---

# Library

Use Framer Motion.

Do not introduce multiple animation libraries.

---

# Principles

Animations should be:

Subtle

Natural

Consistent

Fast

---

# Duration

Recommended:

150ms

200ms

300ms

Maximum:

500ms

---

# Easing

Prefer smooth easing.

Avoid bounce effects unless intentionally designed.

---

# Entrance

Fade

Slide

Scale

Blur

Use sparingly.

---

# Scroll

Avoid excessive scroll-triggered animations.

Do not animate every element.

---

# Hover

Hover should provide feedback,

not entertainment.

---

# Accessibility

Respect prefers-reduced-motion.

Provide graceful degradation.

---

# Goal

Premium experience,

not flashy effects.